<h2>Contact Form</h2>

<p class="hint">
	Seeded state: integration on, <code>toEmail</code> pointed at Mailpit
	(<code>spark lab list</code> shows its UI port). A failed verification is
	flagged as <em>spam</em> per Contact Form&rsquo;s convention &mdash; the sender still
	sees the success message &mdash; so Mailpit is the source of truth here.
</p>

<ol class="hint">
	<li>Solve the widget, submit &mdash; success flash <em>and</em> the message lands in Mailpit.</li>
	<li>Submit without touching the widget &mdash; same success flash, but <strong>no email in Mailpit</strong>: the message was spam-flagged and went nowhere.</li>
</ol>

<form method="post">
	{{ csrfInput() }}
	{{ actionInput('contact-form/send') }}
	{{ redirectInput('lab-test?page=contact-form') }}

	<label for="cf-name">Name</label>
	<input id="cf-name" name="fromName" type="text" value="Lab Visitor">

	<label for="cf-email">Email</label>
	<input id="cf-email" name="fromEmail" type="email" value="visitor@lab.test">

	<label for="cf-subject">Subject</label>
	<input id="cf-subject" name="subject" type="text" value="Smoke test message">

	<label for="cf-message">Message</label>
	<textarea id="cf-message" name="message[body]">Hello from the smoke lab.</textarea>

	{{ craft.altcha.renderWidget() }}

	<p><button type="submit">Send</button></p>
</form>
